      <div class="local-box">
        <h3>Kitchens tailored to Las Mercedes</h3>
        <p>Las Mercedes combines 80s-90s residential buildings with new towers. There are apartments of 90 to 200 m² and several lofts in mixed-use buildings. It is a dynamic area with high owner turnover. Las Mercedes' nightlife and commercial activity mean many apartments are remodeled for quick rental or resale. We optimize budgets to maximize return without sacrificing quality on critical points.</p>
      </div>

